  "Windows Firewall blocks Lazy Scan": {},
  "A Windows Firewall rule stops phones from reaching Lazy Scan on this network. This happens when the firewall's question was cancelled or the network type was not ticked. Someone with administrator rights can open Windows Defender Firewall with Advanced Security (wf.msc), select Inbound Rules and delete the rules for Lazy Scan that block it. Windows then asks again.": {},
  "A Windows Firewall rule stops phones from reaching Lazy Scan on this network. This happens when the firewall's question was cancelled or the network type was not ticked. Someone with administrator rights can open Windows Defender Firewall with Advanced Security (wf.msc), select Inbound Rules and delete {0} that block it. Windows then asks again.": {},
  "Windows Firewall will ask once": {},
  "When Lazy Scan starts receiving, Windows Firewall asks whether to allow it. Choose Allow, with Public networks ticked for the networks you allowed that Windows treats as public. Cancel blocks phones until the rule it makes is removed.": {},
  "When Lazy Scan starts receiving, Windows Firewall asks whether to allow it. Choose Allow. Cancel blocks phones until the rule it makes is removed.": {},
